  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Oblique aerial photographs and observations of progression of spring river ice break up will be used as part of the Canadian IPY project entitled 'Arctic Freshwater Systems: Hydrology and Ecology'. These data will be used as part of the development of the Mackenzie Delta Hydrodynamic Model. They will be used as input data for the simulation of ice jam and other river ice break up processes using the Mackenzie Delta Hydrodynamic Model."
